"""IssueLens - AI-Powered GitHub Issue Onboarding Dashboard.
"""
IssueLens - Hackathon MVP
AI-Powered GitHub Issue Analysis Tool using Gemma 4.
Senior-grade Streamlit application:
- Dark developer aesthetic with minimal, purposeful styling.
- Multi-step progress indicators for transparent loading states.
- Separation of verified repository evidence from AI hypotheses.
- Gemma 4 (gemma-4-26b-a4b-it) model attribution and schema-validated output.
- Interactive PR contribution checklist, file evidence cards, and test generator.
Provides an evidence-grounded, beginner-friendly contribution report for any public GitHub issue.
"""
